# What Docker may see when building (the "build context").
# Everything is excluded first, then only what the API image needs is let
# back in. Safer than listing what to leave out: a new secret file can never
# slip into an image by accident.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
!packages/shared/
!apps/api/

# ...but never these, even inside the folders above:
**/.env*
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/coverage
apps/api/src/generated
